{
  "title": "PlayerProfile",
  "description": "Perfil raiz del jugador. PK=PLAYER#<uuid>, SK=PROFILE. Se lee en MATCH_JOIN dentro de la misma Query que inventario y monedas.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "PK",
    "SK",
    "entity_type",
    "entity_version",
    "version",
    "display_name",
    "created_at",
    "updated_at",
    "progression",
    "flags"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "PK": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/playerPK" },
    "SK": { "const": "PROFILE" },
    "entity_type": { "const": "PROFILE" },
    "entity_version": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/schemaVersion" },
    "version": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/lockVersion" },

    "display_name": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 3,
      "maxLength": 16,
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_]+$"
    },
    "created_at": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/epochMillis" },
    "updated_at": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/epochMillis" },
    "last_login_at": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/epochMillis" },

    "progression": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["level", "xp", "prestige"],
      "properties": {
        "level": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 100 },
        "xp": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "xp_to_next": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
        "prestige": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 10 }
      }
    },

    "loadout": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["primary_style"],
      "properties": {
        "primary_style": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/combatStyle" },
        "secondary_style": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/combatStyle" },
        "equipped": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 8,
          "uniqueItems": true,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^ITEM#[a-z0-9_]{3,48}#[0-9a-f]{8}$",
            "description": "Sort Key del InventoryItem equipado. Referencia debil: el repository layer valida que el item exista y su state sea EQUIPPED."
          },
          "description": "Array acotado a 8 slots a proposito. Es el unico array del modelo con cota fija; el inventario completo NO vive aqui."
        }
      }
    },

    "squad_ref": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/squadPK" },

    "active_session": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["match_id", "expires_at"],
      "properties": {
        "match_id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^m_[0-9a-f]{6,16}$" },
        "server_id": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 64 },
        "expires_at": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/epochMillis" }
      },
      "description": "Lease de sesion. Escrito en MATCH_JOIN con ConditionExpression: attribute_not_exists(active_session) OR active_session.expires_at < :now. Garantiza un unico escritor logico del inventario y cierra el exploit de doble consumo en partidas simultaneas."
    },

    "flags": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["banned"],
      "properties": {
        "banned": { "type": "boolean" },
        "shadow_flagged": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Marcado por el job antifraude del Lakehouse. No se comunica al cliente."
        },
        "trade_locked_until": { "$ref": "_common.json#/$defs/epochMillis" }
      }
    }
  },

  "$comment": "El perfil NO escribe gsi1pk/gsi1sk. GSI1 es un indice esparso reservado al inventario (ITEMDEF# -> propietarios). La consulta 'a que escuadron pertenece este jugador' se resuelve con squad_ref, que ya viene en la Query de MATCH_JOIN.",

  "examples": [
    {
      "PK": "PLAYER#7f3a9c21-4e88-4b0a-9d13-6ac2f0e51b77",
      "SK": "PROFILE",
      "entity_type": "PROFILE",
      "entity_version": 1,
      "version": 42,
      "display_name": "NeonRonin",
      "created_at": 1788048000000,
      "updated_at": 1788220800000,
      "last_login_at": 1788220800000,
      "progression": { "level": 27, "xp": 184320, "xp_to_next": 12800, "prestige": 1 },
      "loadout": {
        "primary_style": "STRIKING",
        "secondary_style": "CLINCH",
        "equipped": ["ITEM#gauntlet_mk2#a91f4d02", "ITEM#visor_neon#c3d0118e"]
      },
      "squad_ref": "SQUAD#1b2c3d4e-5f60-4718-8293-aabbccddeeff",
      "flags": { "banned": false, "shadow_flagged": false }
    }
  ]
}
